## Program Learning Outcomes

Students completing this program will be able to:

- Demonstrate advanced expertise in their chosen field of Christian study.
- Apply scholarly research methodologies to theological investigation.
- Conduct original research in biblical, theological, or ministry-related disciplines.
- Critically examine Pentecostal–Charismatic theology and Christian scholarship.
- Integrate biblical knowledge with advanced academic research.
- Produce scholarly research that contributes to Christian education and theology.
- Demonstrate academic integrity and advanced research competencies.
